 "remarks": "Welcome to **41 Valley Road in Cos Cob!** This spacious and inviting four-bedroom, three-full-bath residence is available for either a short-term or annual lease, offering flexibility for a variety of rental needs.  The home features a comfortable and functional layout with beautiful hardwood floors, newer appliances, granite countertops, and the convenience of in-unit laundry. Enjoy cozy evenings by the wood-burning fireplace or relax and entertain outdoors on the private rooftop deck.  One-car parking is included, and small dogs are welcome. Conveniently located within walking distance of local shops, restaurants, parks, and the center of Cos Cob, with easy access to Greenwich amenities and transportation.  Clean, well maintained, and move-in ready, this home offers a wonderful opportunity to enjoy the convenience and lifestyle of Cos Cob.  **Short-term lease options are available at a premium. Please inquire for pricing and availability.**",
